@baseAddress = https://localhost:5001

### List users
GET {{baseAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve a single user
@userId = 8c48ce8e-9650-4dc5-ae2c-237635b38767
GET {{baseAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a user
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
	"firstName": "Jamie",
	"lastName": "Rivera",
	"email": "jamie.rivera@example.com",
	"phoneNumber": "+1-646-555-0172",
	"notes": "Requested early access to the new analytics dashboard"
}

### Update a user
PUT {{baseAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
	"firstName": "Alex",
	"lastName": "Johnson",
	"email": "alex.johnson@example.com",
	"phoneNumber": "+1-404-555-0100",
	"notes": "Promoted to solutions architect in Q3",
	"isActive": true
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{baseAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json
